    <p><em>Last Updated: August 2024</em></p>

    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>CreateFitnessApp ("we", "us", or "our") operates the createfitnessapp.com website (the "Service"). This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our Service.</p>

